          "source": "",
          "thread": "Sanctions and illicit-finance exposure",
          "why": "The $20B Garantex investigation and the T3 unit's $100M Tron freeze (including North Korea-linked funds) pulled readers tracking how USDT's permissionless reach becomes a liability under law enforcement scrutiny."
        },
        {
          "source": "",
          "thread": "Reserve audit transparency deficit",
          "why": "Tether's talks with a Big Four firm over $140B in issued USDT drew readers who see the long-delayed audit as the single unresolved systemic risk underneath the entire stablecoin ecosystem."
        },
